title: "APS (AI Production Standard)"
abstract: >-
  An open standard for documenting AI use and managing intellectual property
  rights in audiovisual production. Published in Polish and English; the Polish
  text governs.
message: "If you reference this standard, please cite it as below."
type: standard
authors:
